{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ffe248461754bac7","type":"text","text":"压缩后的码流","x":-100,"y":680,"width":160,"height":60},
		{"id":"af81ff216fdf5f71","type":"text","text":"YUV格式","x":-860,"y":-700,"width":171,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1486bd2c4a07164a","type":"text","text":"码流的种类","x":480,"y":400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"048e0f86bee960fc","type":"text","text":"网络传输","x":-600,"y":1225,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"5486b5af590cda9c","type":"text","text":"码率（Bitrate）：每秒传多少数据  Mbps（兆比特 / 秒）","x":8602,"y":-7200,"width":471,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"616e20eeb5660ed8","type":"text","text":"- **马赛克严重**：码率太低，动态画面压缩过度\n- **突然卡顿**：用了 VBR 模式，码率瞬间飙升超过无线带宽\n- **静态画面也卡**：CBR 码率设太高，超过了当前距离的无线吞吐量","x":9160,"y":-7080,"width":533,"height":100},
		{"id":"3f0f023a93090cef","type":"text","text":"**I 帧（关键帧）**：完整编码一帧画面，不依赖任何其他帧，体积最大","x":9317,"y":-6660,"width":360,"height":60},
		{"id":"cb3d0823b424f6be","type":"text","text":"**P 帧（预测帧）**：只编码和前一帧的差异，体积小，依赖前面的 I/P 帧","x":9317,"y":-6533,"width":376,"height":66},
		{"id":"75eafc5a6a9fd399","type":"text","text":"**B 帧（双向预测帧）**：编码和前后帧的差异，体积最小，依赖前后的 I/P 帧","x":9317,"y":-6390,"width":376,"height":60},
		{"id":"ba0271a8e6b3e02c","type":"text","text":"GOP（Group of Pictures）：一组连续的视频帧","x":8580,"y":-6360,"width":515,"height":65,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0d38af6ac753be80","type":"file","file":"音视频开发/source_video_development/Pasted image 20260611193629.png","x":9497,"y":-6218,"width":400,"height":156},
		{"id":"fba51bc391c88be2","type":"text","text":"GOP 长度 = 两个 IDR 帧之间的帧数","x":9011,"y":-6240,"width":356,"height":64},
		{"id":"0e7e0cf3b012a9b8","type":"text","text":"- **音画不同步严重**：GOP 太长，解码延迟高\n- **丢包后花屏很久才恢复**：GOP 太长，要等到下一个 IDR 帧才能恢复\n- **码率很高但画质差**：GOP 太短，I 帧太多，浪费码率","x":8680,"y":-6140,"width":589,"height":120},
		{"id":"eb9825fd472f0508","type":"text","text":"重要概念","x":8200,"y":-5900,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9e302dfe32930040","type":"text","text":"QP（Quantization Parameter）：量化参数，压缩程度开关","x":8569,"y":-5740,"width":507,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c4435e261096eb9c","type":"text","text":"IDR 帧（Instantaneous Decoder Refresh）：立即解码刷新帧","x":8562,"y":-5175,"width":522,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"49c0aea58a6daf40","type":"text","text":"DTS（Decoding Time Stamp）：","x":8595,"y":-4597,"width":455,"height":85},
		{"id":"e8044865eba57150","type":"text","text":"H.264","x":7160,"y":-5397,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"22f6edde441572e8","type":"text","text":"码流\n比特流","x":7294,"y":-4957,"width":116,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"57da8e1a7a96fba5","type":"link","url":"https://stephenzhou.blog.csdn.net/article/details/127180927","x":6128,"y":-4597,"width":752,"height":384},
		{"id":"2cfb59da002b867e","type":"text","text":"- **QP=0**：无损压缩，画质最好，码率最高\n- **QP 越小**：画质越好，码率越高\n- **QP 越大**：画质越差，码率越低\n- **QP=51**：压缩最狠，画质最差，码率最低","x":9189,"y":-5740,"width":570,"height":148},
		{"id":"d202fcf5ad375fae","type":"text","text":"- **暗部细节丢失**：最大 QP 设太高\n- **码率一直很高降不下来**：最小 QP 设太低\n- **画面忽亮忽暗**：QP 波动太大，编码器调整太频繁","x":9149,"y":-5540,"width":499,"height":114},
		{"id":"27b477de2aec412c","type":"text","text":"`IDR间隔=30帧（1秒）`，兼顾恢复速度和码率","x":10000,"y":-5380,"width":411,"height":71},
		{"id":"42f7a3414a3982d0","type":"text","text":"- **IDR 间隔越短**：丢包后恢复越快，随机访问越流畅，但码率越高\n- **IDR 间隔越长**：码率越低，但丢包后花屏时间越长","x":9800,"y":-5212,"width":667,"height":75},
		{"id":"cfa457b7af6df145","type":"text","text":"解码器收到 IDR 帧后会**清空所有参考帧缓冲区**，从头开始解码","x":9213,"y":-5200,"width":508,"height":50},
		{"id":"1069609e1b813218","type":"text","text":"IDR 帧 vs 普通 I 帧\n\n| 特性    | IDR 帧  | 普通 I 帧   |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- |\n| 清空参考帧 | ✅ 是    | ❌ 否      |\n| 随机访问点 | ✅ 是    | ❌ 否      |\n| 错误恢复  | ✅ 完全恢复 | ❌ 只能部分恢复 |\n| 编码效率  | 稍低     | 稍高       |\n","x":9238,"y":-5100,"width":410,"height":245},
		{"id":"47143a3dc805ad90","type":"text","text":"- **快进快退卡顿**：IDR 间隔太长，找不到随机访问点\n- **丢包后一直花屏**：IDR 间隔太长，或者根本没有 IDR 帧\n- **热插拔后黑屏**：热插拔后没有立即发送 IDR 帧，解码器无法同步","x":9191,"y":-4820,"width":552,"height":119},
		{"id":"e023198c1e70525b","type":"text","text":"即解码时间戳，这个时间戳的意义在于告诉播放器该在什么时候解码这一帧的数据","x":9191,"y":-4582,"width":457,"height":55},
		{"id":"4a873d8a19cf2064","type":"text","text":"主要描述“整个视频序列”的基本规则。\nprofile_idc        编码档次，比如 Baseline/Main/High\nlevel_idc          编码等级，比如 Level 4.1/5.1\npic_width          图像宽度相关信息\npic_height         图像高度相关信息\nframe_mbs_only     是否逐行/隔行\nchroma_format      色彩采样格式，比如 yuv420\nbit_depth          位深，比如 8bit/10bit\nlog2_max_frame_num 帧号相关参数\npoc_type           显示顺序计算方式","x":9409,"y":-4277,"width":656,"height":277},
		{"id":"73adb62e3e67487a","type":"text","text":"pic_parameter_set_id       PPS 自己的 ID\nseq_parameter_set_id       它引用哪个 SPS\nentropy_coding_mode        熵编码方式，CAVLC 或 CABAC\nnum_slice_groups           slice 分组方式\nweighted_pred              加权预测相关\npic_init_qp                初始量化参数\ndeblocking_filter          去块滤波相关\ntransform_8x8_mode         是否允许 8x8 变换","x":9626,"y":-3851,"width":477,"height":258},
		{"id":"6497de002531ea38","type":"text","text":"SEI 通常不是解码画面必须的核心数据。没有 SEI，大多数情况下视频仍然能解码。","x":9580,"y":-3495,"width":431,"height":85},
		{"id":"5e88d20fabd4240c","type":"text","text":"编码器信息\nHDR 信息\n色彩信息\n时间码\n用户自定义数据\n画面显示相关提示\n缓冲区时序信息","x":9580,"y":-3357,"width":429,"height":206},
		{"id":"e8a8db1abb4b27e4","type":"text","text":"一张没有P帧，包含每包大小的原始H264文件","x":8640,"y":-2917,"width":300,"height":53},
		{"id":"ee53af71a7049308","type":"text","text":"SEI = 补充增强信息，Supplemental Enhancement Information","x":8715,"y":-3453,"width":696,"height":65},
		{"id":"46da6eb26a19abbb","type":"text","text":"\nIDR/P/B slice = 真正的压缩画面数据\n","x":8740,"y":-3254,"width":452,"height":73},
		{"id":"2847f2879d60001c","type":"text","text":"PPS = 图像参数集，Picture Parameter Set","x":8763,"y":-3816,"width":560,"height":67},
		{"id":"2c1f4d21533f032f","type":"text","text":"SPS:SPS = 序列参数集，Sequence Parameter Set\n\n","x":8800,"y":-4139,"width":440,"height":60},
		{"id":"4a4ce7063c92c214","type":"file","file":"音视频开发/source_video_development/Pasted image 20260612101610.png","x":8200,"y":-3707,"width":400,"height":192},
		{"id":"fd30d57a227ad9e1","type":"file","file":"音视频开发/source_video_development/Pasted image 20260617144826.png","x":8640,"y":-2756,"width":304,"height":400},
		{"id":"7a3b67b16031b570","type":"file","file":"音视频开发/source_video_development/Pasted image 20260612095330.png","x":8180,"y":-4100,"width":400,"height":244},
		{"id":"53b6be6895b49d83","type":"text","text":"每个IDR前接SPS和PPS的H264数据，防止网络丢包出现卡顿解析不了的情况，不包括每包的大小信息\n\n00 00 00 01 67   ->   SPS\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 68   ->   PPS\n（内容）\n00 00 01 06        ->   SEI\n（内容）\n00 00 01 65        ->   IDR\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n==**00 00 00 01 67   ->   SPS**==\n==**（内容）**==\n==**00 00 00 01 68   ->   PPS**==\n==**（内容）**==\n00 00 01 65        ->   IDR\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 01   ->   B帧\n（内容）\n00 00 00 01 41   ->   P帧 可参考\n\n\n","x":6880,"y":-3565,"width":560,"height":1618},
		{"id":"85f93b6454a4d0ee","type":"text","text":"使用ffmpeg查看  ffprobe -show_frames -select_streams v -show_entries frame=pict_type,key_frame,pkt_pos,pkt_size -of csv output.h264\n\n\n$ ffprobe -show_frames -select_streams v -show_entries frame=pict_type,key_frame,pkt_pos,pkt_size -of csv output.h264\nffprobe version n5.0.1-4-ga5ebb3d25e-20220526 Copyright (c) 2007-2022 the FFmpeg developers\n  built with gcc 11.2.0 (crosstool-NG 1.24.0.533_681aaef)\n  configuration: --prefix=/ffbuild/prefix --pkg-config-flags=--static --pkg-config=pkg-config --cross-prefix=x86_64-w64-mingw32- --arch=x86_64 --target-os=mingw32 --enable-gpl --enable-version3 --disable-debug --disable-w32threads --enable-pthreads --enable-iconv --enable-libxml2 --enable-zlib --enable-libfreetype --enable-libfribidi --enable-gmp --enable-lzma --enable-fontconfig --enable-libvorbis --enable-opencl --disable-libpulse --enable-libvmaf --disable-libxcb --disable-xlib --enable-amf --enable-libaom --enable-libaribb24 --enable-avisynth --enable-libdav1d --enable-libdavs2 --disable-libfdk-aac --enable-ffnvcodec --enable-cuda-llvm --enable-frei0r --enable-libgme --enable-libass --enable-libbluray --enable-libmp3lame --enable-libopus --enable-librist --enable-libtheora --enable-libvpx --enable-libwebp --enable-lv2 --enable-libmfx --enable-libopencore-amrnb --enable-libopencore-amrwb --enable-libopenh264 --enable-libopenjpeg --enable-libopenmpt --enable-librav1e --enable-librubberband --enable-schannel --enable-sdl2 --enable-libsoxr --enable-libsrt --enable-libsvtav1 --enable-libtwolame --enable-libuavs3d --disable-libdrm --disable-vaapi --enable-libvidstab --enable-vulkan --enable-libshaderc --enable-libplacebo --enable-libx264 --enable-libx265 --enable-libxavs2 --enable-libxvid --enable-libzimg --enable-libzvbi --extra-cflags=-DLIBTWOLAME_STATIC --extra-cxxflags= --extra-ldflags=-pthread --extra-ldexeflags= --extra-libs=-lgomp --extra-version=20220526\n  libavutil      57. 17.100 / 57. 17.100\n  libavcodec     59